{"id":"262edf2a6e5cc334","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-pcf2-filtered-product.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Filtered Product","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-filtered-product — ZFC Pcf2 Filtered Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-filtered-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-filtered-product"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-filtered-product — ZFC Pcf2 Filtered Product","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-filtered-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-filtered-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-filtered-product — ZFC Pcf2 Filtered Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (set of regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (proper filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (full product carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_F,=_F\">\\(\\leq_F,=_F\\)</span> (order and equality modulo the filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\\)</span> (proper set-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilteredProduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilteredProduct}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}product}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilteredProduct}_S(A,F,P,\\leq_F,=_F)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(A,F)\\land P=\\{f\\in V:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\\}\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\Bigl(f\\leq_Fg\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)\\leq g(a)\\}\\in F\\Bigr)\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\Bigl(f=_Fg\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in F\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}product}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilteredProduct}_S(A,F,P,\\leq_F,=_F)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(A,F)\\land P=\\{f\\in V:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\\}\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\Bigl(f\\leq_Fg\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)\\leq g(a)\\}\\in F\\Bigr)\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\Bigl(f=_Fg\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in F\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product carrier is a bounded collection of functions with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; the former expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{f:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\cdots\\}\">\\(\\{f:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\cdots\\}\\)</span> did not bind <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> to a set domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F$ (proper filter on $A$, see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S$ (proper set-filter predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_F,=_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilteredProduct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}product}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilteredProduct}_S(A,F,P,\\leq_F,=_F)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(A,F)\\land P=\\{f\\in V:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\\}\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\Bigl(f\\leq_Fg\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)\\leq g(a)\\}\\in F\\Bigr)\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\Bigl(f=_Fg\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in F\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\{f:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\cdots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1613,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ad1a6f956cc0231","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilteredProduct}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-pcf2-f